{"user":"Omar Shehata","message":"I think the correct answer here, and this is how I would test if someone is at a minimum level of understanding to contribute to discussions of \"aesthetics-as-information\", is that the update to intuition happens only when an update to reality happens\n\nwe can understand this concretely if we think about how stereotypes form on first contact between two distinct races or cultures","timestamp":"2026-09-08T16:33:12.955000+00:00","channel":"✍️eval-log","channel_id":"discord:1409673828673523762","thread":"When does intuition update?","thread_id":"discord:1546920840124309614","reply_to":null,"id":"discord:1546921361350459489","user_id":"discord:228707291317141504","is_bot":false,"url":"https://discord.com/channels/1344300408893345863/1546920840124309614/1546921361350459489","attachments":[],"platform":"discord","server":"ORI (est. 2025)","server_id":"discord:1344300408893345863"}
{"user":"Omar Shehata","message":"> think about how stereotypes form on first contact between two distinct races or cultures\n\nthink about the first impression between Arabs & Chinese, or blacks & whites, upon encountering each other for the first time\n\nwhat is their orientation towards each other? \n\nThink about how that changes as:\n\n- someone argues logically \n- vs, when something happens, when a Chinese kills an Arab, or scams them, or when one makes a successful trade with one","timestamp":"2026-09-08T16:35:12.035000+00:00","channel":"✍️eval-log","channel_id":"discord:1409673828673523762","thread":"When does intuition update?","thread_id":"discord:1546920840124309614","reply_to":null,"id":"discord:1546921860808314910","user_id":"discord:228707291317141504","is_bot":false,"url":"https://discord.com/channels/1344300408893345863/1546920840124309614/1546921860808314910","attachments":[],"platform":"discord","server":"ORI (est. 2025)","server_id":"discord:1344300408893345863"}
